<title>USA: Gentle Dentle IPO delayed - underwriter.</title>
<headline>Gentle Dentle IPO delayed - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of Gentle Dentle Services Corp has been delayed until January because of market conditions, lead underwriter for the deal, Black &amp; Co, said Friday.</p>
<p>The offering of 1.25 million shares was expected to price the week of December 2 at $5 a share.</p>
<p>The company filed to trade on the Nasdaq market under the symbol GNTL.O.</p>
</text>
